  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agri mission Kurdish region of Iraq</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The government of Iraq has a high interest in cooperation with the Netherlands in the field of agriculture. Contributing to this private sector led mission helps the Netherlands Consulate-General in Erbil giving shape to the private sector development (PSD) strategy which has a focus on business development and knowledge transfer between the Netherlands and the Kurdistan Region (KRI). At the same time it helps to strengthen bilateral relations. The primary objective of this mission is to establish connections and create potential business opportunities for companies that are active in the agriculture sector while at the same time contributing to local challenges.</narrative>
  </description>
